{"sourceUrl":"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg3/a2b988234a0a44d19756308eb16f3213.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:11.805554+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg3/a2b988234a0a44d19756308eb16f3213.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>为促进全国优秀大学生加深对我系教学、科研及人才培养等方面的了解，</span><span>我系</span><span>定于202</span><span>5</span><span>年7月举办</span><span>“</span><span>202</span><span>5</span><span>年全国优秀大学生暑期网上</span><span>交流</span><span>”</span><span>活动，现将活动</span><span>内容</span><span>公布如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>一、报名条件</span></p>\n<p><span>1. 拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德端正，遵纪守法，在校期间无学术不端行为，无违纪表现。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 勤奋好学，思维敏捷，有较强的创新意识、创新能力。有希望获得所在学校推免资格的优秀本科三年级在校生（202</span><span>6</span><span>年应届本科毕业生）。</span></p>\n<p><span>3. 本科专业应为电气工程类。另外，为进一步加强学科交叉研究，欢迎工学门类下的机械类（0802）、材料类（0804）、能源动力类（0805）、电子信息类（0807）、自动化类（0808）、计算机类（0809），以及理学门类下的数学类（0701）、物理学类（0702）相关专业同学参加</span><span>交叉学科专项计划学术交流（学生所在专业的学分绩须位于前5%</span><span>）</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>4. 英语要求：具有良好的英语应用能力，CET4</span><span>≥</span><span>425或TOEFL</span><span>≥</span><span>90或IELTS</span><span>≥</span><span>6.0。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>二、报名须知</span></p>\n<p><span>1. 请登录电力工程系研究生招生服务系统进行注册报名：</span><a href=\"http://59.67.225.29/zs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://59.67.225.29/zs/</span></a><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2. 报名时间</span><span>：202</span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span><span>-7</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>中午14:30</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>. </span><span>线上宣讲时间：</span><span>预计</span><span>7月11日8:30，</span><span>通过线上</span><span>腾讯</span><span>会议的形式</span><span>进行。</span><span>届时将对</span><span>我系</span><span>总体</span><span>情况</span><span>进行介绍、对</span><span>交叉学科专项计划政策</span><span>进行解读，各团队代表老师将</span><span>进行科研团队宣讲</span><span>。</span><span>会议号及具体安排，将于7月10日在电力工程系官网主页公布</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>4</span><span>. </span><span>个人材料上传时间：</span><span>7月11日8:00-7</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span><span>23:59</span><span>，</span><span>学生可</span><span>按照《</span><span>学员</span><span>须知》提供个人风采相关材料，与导师</span><span>线上</span><span>互动。</span><span>我系将根据上传材料和与导师沟通情况推荐</span><span>“</span><span>优秀学员</span><span>”</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>5.</span><span>为了方便联系，</span><span>我系</span><span>建立了</span><span>“</span><span>电力工程系</span><span>202</span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span>学术交流通知</span><span>群</span><span>”</span><span>（群二维码如下）</span><span>,</span><span>后续通知</span><span>也</span><span>将在群内发布</span><span>（</span><span>包括参与交叉学科学术交流的导师及研究方向等</span><span>）。</span></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/267fbafd44934b4594785db04b525c02.jpeg\"/><br/><span> </span><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/ee2a85bf5b2a41c5a496c0d1ee8dabdc.jpeg\"/><br/></p>\n<p><span>6</span><span>. 相关信息请关注我系网站通知公告：</span><a href=\"http://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>http://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/</span></a><span>。导师信息除招生服务系统外，还可通过我系师资队伍网页了解https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/szdw/szdwjj/index.htm。</span></p>\n<p><span>7</span><span>. 信息咨询电话：0312-7522581。</span></p>\n<p><span></span><span>                                                     电力工程系</span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span>5</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>4</span><span>日</span></p>\n<p><span>附件：报名系统说明</span></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/26ccfd9cf96d44d9a05006f4393d8e42.png\"/><br/><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/2d595769e68446e792ba980692297ced.png\"/><br/><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/a541c0cf87094d70b662fc863e2decff.png\"/><br/></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/5101b19ec1f64538a19b1124163bd8a3.png\"/><br/><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/3af18d1d5cc8405ab65fe74ae141fc24.png\"/><br/></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/76572b045c3d48199714d7aa153c1d58.png\"/><br/></p>\n<p><br/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ee.ncepu.edu.cn/images/2025-07/3f2fe31f809c4bb4aa57771c9a9fe8f3.png\"/><br/><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>11</span><span>日</span><span>-7</span><span>月</span><span>15</span><span>日上传个人材料，系统账号为：身份证号，初始密码为身份证号后六位</span><span>。登陆后，请及时更改密码。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span><span> </span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"142c608692063fd87640601955934dd24d414495760e80a845574db37acee626","textLength":1000,"sourceSha256":"5026a7d24fa744c070f39724f7b88636b1129b450fdfd60792fd7959f0828ea3","selector":"article-like:gp-article1 gp-article gp-f16","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ab1c77f8c63eee657159","title":"2025年华北电力大学电力工程系关于举办全国优秀大学生暑期网上学术交流活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:11.805554+00:00"}
